"User can specify the tuning desired using the "
":ref:`AUTOTUNE_SEQ<AUTOTUNE_SEQ>` parameter.  Individual gain tuning or "
"combination of tuning several gains can be specified using the bitmask.  "
"Rate P and Rate D are conducted together and always preceded with "
"determining max gains allowable."
