msgid ":ref:`Maximum Response Gain<AUTOTUNE_GN_MAX>`"
msgstr ":ref:`最大响应增益<AUTOTUNE_GN_MAX>`"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:87
#: 61a520655d6745b080e9a9f51017460a
msgid ""
"The :ref:`AUTOTUNE_GN_MAX<AUTOTUNE_GN_MAX>` parameter specifies the maximum "
"response gain to be used to tune the Rate D, Rate P and Angle P gains.  The "
"response gain is the output of the response divided by the input.  It is "
"recommended that 1.8 to 2.0 be used for pitch and roll axes as these axes "
"are typically more lightly damped.  It is recommended that 1.0 to 1.4 be "
"used for the yaw axis."
msgstr ""
":ref:`AUTOTUNE_GN_MAX<AUTOTUNE_GN_MAX>` 参数指定用于调参速率 D、速率 P 和角度 P "
"增益的最大响应增益。响应增益是响应输出除以输入的值。建议俯仰和横滚轴使用 1.8 到 2.0，因为这些轴通常阻尼较轻。建议偏航轴使用 1.0 到 "
"1.4。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:91
#: 59011251d95a411d85952735d464541c
msgid ":ref:`Minimum Test Frequency<AUTOTUNE_FRQ_MIN>`"
msgstr ":ref:`最小测试频率<AUTOTUNE_FRQ_MIN>`"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:93
#: 097f1ec4ff684fc8b99b59cc2d07902a
msgid ""
"The :ref:`AUTOTUNE_FRQ_MIN<AUTOTUNE_FRQ_MIN>` parameter specifies the "
"minimum frequency in radians per second used during the dwell or frequency "
"sweeps.  For frequency sweeps, this will be the starting frequency.  The "
"default value is good for helicopters with rotor diameters less than 1.4 "
"meters."
msgstr ""
":ref:`AUTOTUNE_FRQ_MIN<AUTOTUNE_FRQ_MIN>` "
"参数指定驻波或频率扫频期间使用的最小频率（弧度/秒）。对于频率扫频，这将是起始频率。默认值适用于旋翼直径小于 1.4 米的直升机。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:97
#: f45b8541f2254a8580e3632b6745bb5c
msgid ":ref:`Maximum Test Frequency<AUTOTUNE_FRQ_MAX>`"
msgstr ":ref:`最大测试频率<AUTOTUNE_FRQ_MAX>`"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:99
#: 06af0b426a9a41c0aabaeafa9702683d
msgid ""
"The :ref:`AUTOTUNE_FRQ_MAX<AUTOTUNE_FRQ_MAX>` parameter specifies the "
"maximum frequency in radians per second used during the dwell or frequency "
"sweeps.  For frequency sweeps, this will be the ending frequency.  The "
"default value is fine for helicopters with rotor diameters greater than 1.2 "
"meters.  Consider raising to 100 radians/sec for helicopters with rotor "
"diameters less then 1.2 meters."
msgstr ""
":ref:`AUTOTUNE_FRQ_MAX<AUTOTUNE_FRQ_MAX>` "
"参数指定驻波或频率扫频期间使用的最大频率（弧度/秒）。对于频率扫频，这将是结束频率。默认值适用于旋翼直径大于 1.2 米的直升机。对于旋翼直径小于 "
"1.2 米的直升机，考虑将其提高到 100 弧度/秒。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:103
#: 8a26f4db5d7d47528e0f5d01a4893ab3
msgid ":ref:`Velocity P Gain<AUTOTUNE_VELXY_P>`"
msgstr ":ref:`速度 P 增益<AUTOTUNE_VELXY_P>`"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:105
#: 736b8bac2aeb443e8b2ec58ebaa98b62
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The :ref:`AUTOTUNE_VELXY_P<AUTOTUNE_VELXY_P>` parameter specifies P gain for"
" velocity feedback.  This aids the AutoTune in maintaining aircraft position"
" during the frequency sweeps and dwells.  It does not apply to "
"``ATC_RAT_xxx_FF`` tuning.  Keep this at 0.1 unless the aircraft is drifting"
" more than 10 meters during the dwell and frequency sweeps.  It only affects"
" position holding while the aircraft is oscillating during these tests.  If "
"it does drift more than 10 meters during the dwell and frequency sweep tests"
" then increase this parameter but don't increase much beyond 0.2. In between"
" the oscillations, it may drift if the aircraft wasn't properly trimmed for "
"hover.  This gain will not help with that."
msgstr ""
":ref:`AUTOTUNE_VELXY_P<AUTOTUNE_VELXY_P>` 参数指定速度反馈的 P 增益。这有助于 AutoTune "
"在频率扫频和驻波期间保持飞行器位置。它不适用于 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_FF`` 调参。除非飞行器在驻波和频率扫频期间漂移超过 10 "
"米，否则将其保持在 0.1。它只影响飞行器在这些测试中振荡时的位置保持。如果在驻波和频率扫频测试期间漂移超过 10 米，则增加此参数，但不要超过 "
"0.2。在振荡之间，如果飞行器未正确配平悬停，可能会漂移。此增益对此没有帮助。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:108
#: 4522484e10844462a68c4894f8ee6e28
msgid ":ref:`Maximum Allowable Angular Acceleration<AUTOTUNE_ACC_MAX>`"
msgstr ":ref:`最大允许角加速度<AUTOTUNE_ACC_MAX>`"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:110
#: 35349fc0653c4202b1e2630bb7a23dc5
msgid ""
"The :ref:`AUTOTUNE_ACC_MAX<AUTOTUNE_ACC_MAX>` parameter specifies maximum "
"allowable angular acceleration in deg/s/s during autotune maneuvers.  This "
"is only available in version Copter-4.6 and subsequent. This parameter "
"limits the requested acceleration.  This does not guarantee the actual "
"aircraft acceleration will be that which was requested.  It is likely that "
"the response will be less than the requested acceleration.  If the response "
"is too low, the resulting analysis may not be good enough for autotune to "
"work well.  If the actual response is much lower, consider increasing the "
"acceleration parameter so that there is a larger response for analysis.  The"
" rate response can be used to estimate the actual acceleration by "
"multiplying the magnitude in deg/s of the oscillatory response by the "
"frequency in rad/s."
msgstr ""
":ref:`AUTOTUNE_ACC_MAX<AUTOTUNE_ACC_MAX>` "
"参数指定自动调参机动期间最大允许角加速度（deg/s/s）。此功能仅在 Copter-4.6 "
"及后续版本中可用。此参数限制请求的加速度。这不保证实际飞行器加速度与请求相同。实际响应可能低于请求的加速度。如果响应太低，所得分析可能不足以使自动调参正常工作。如果实际响应远低于请求，考虑增加加速度参数以获得更大的分析响应。速率响应可用于通过将振荡响应的幅度（deg/s）乘以频率（rad/s）来估算实际加速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:113
#: 3c1c7d5768064894ae281871925f6108
msgid ":ref:`Maximum Allowable Angular Rate<AUTOTUNE_RAT_MAX>`"
msgstr ":ref:`最大允许角速率<AUTOTUNE_RAT_MAX>`"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:115
#: 30950b19edd14a04988e19988c119d3a
msgid ""
"The :ref:`AUTOTUNE_RAT_MAX<AUTOTUNE_RAT_MAX>` parameter specifies maximum "
"allowable angular rate in deg/s during autotune maneuvers.  This is only "
"available in version Copter-4.6 and subsequent. This parameter limits the "
"requested rate.  This does not guarantee the actual aircraft rate will be "
"that which was requested.  It is likely that the response will be less than "
"the requested acceleration.  If the response is too low, the resulting "
"analysis may not be good enough for autotune to work well.  If the actual "
"response is much lower, consider increasing the rate parameter so that there"
" is a larger response for analysis.  The actual rate can be evaluated from "
"the RATE log message."
msgstr ""
":ref:`AUTOTUNE_RAT_MAX<AUTOTUNE_RAT_MAX>` 参数指定自动调参机动期间最大允许角速率（deg/s）。此功能仅在 "
"Copter-4.6 "
"及后续版本中可用。此参数限制请求的速率。这不保证实际飞行器速率与请求相同。实际响应可能低于请求的加速度。如果响应太低，所得分析可能不足以使自动调参正常工作。如果实际响应远低于请求，考虑增加速率参数以获得更大的分析响应。实际速率可从"
" RATE 日志消息中评估。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:118
