msgid "Transmitter Setup"
msgstr "遥控器设置"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:125
#: bed2158ec512442ab02bdab3437d9f92
msgid ""
"Be sure to put the AutoTune flight mode as one of the flight modes on your "
"transmitter flight mode switch.  You don’t want to be reaching for the GCS "
"to switch out of the AutoTune if your heli is not behaving properly.  You "
"want to be able to switch modes instantly."
msgstr ""
"务必将 AutoTune 飞行模式作为遥控器飞行模式切换开关上的一个飞行模式。如果直升机行为异常，您不希望还要去找地面站切换出 "
"AutoTune。您希望能够立即切换模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:129
