msgstr "建议调参顺序"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:133
#: 0d58964701d14f89a65b9fe9188a3362
msgid ""
"In any axis, it is recommended to conduct the feedforward gain tuning first,"
" then the Rate D and Rate P gain tuning, and lastly the Angle P tuning.  "
"Don't try to tune every axis in one flight, it could take up to 10-15 min to"
" tune one axis.  Here is a suggested flights and tuning sequence. "
"Conventional helicopters do not need Yaw feedforward tuning, therefore the "
"gain can be set to zero.  Dual helicopters may require Yaw feedforward "
"tuning."
msgstr ""
"在任何轴上，建议先进行前馈增益调参，然后进行速率 D 和速率 P 增益调参，最后进行角度 P 调参。不要尝试在一次飞行中调参所有轴，调参一个轴可能需要 "
"10-15 分钟。以下是建议的飞行和调参顺序。传统直升机不需要偏航前馈调参，因此该增益可设为零。双旋翼直升机可能需要偏航前馈调参。"

