#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:174
#: a68f51b95fb1483483278da3856b547f
msgid "Tuning Flight Procedures"
msgstr "调参飞行程序"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:176
#: 5d418e6b4f524018bc88a6f0f7ff1570
msgid ""
"When conducting an AutoTune flight, be sure to have at least at 50 meter by "
"50 meter area to fly. The aircraft will move during the autotuning process."
"  Do not let the aircraft get too far away."
msgstr "进行 AutoTune 飞行时，请确保至少有 50 米 × 50 米的飞行区域。飞行器在自动调参过程中会移动。不要让飞行器飞得太远。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:178
#: 142048f354a84795bfb1f1923b123bbe
msgid ""
"During the feedforward test, the aircraft may travel 5-10 meters, and "
"perhaps even further with larger helicopters. You may have to bring it back "
"after each iteration of the tuning test."
msgstr "在前馈测试期间，飞行器可能移动 5-10 米，对于更大的直升机甚至更远。每次调参测试迭代后，您可能需要将其带回来。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:180
#: 5146ca579d234cab9e5c74669e9dd421
msgid "Power up the controller."
msgstr "为控制器上电。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:181
#: ca0644d813fe4420ac4911535c1d5fa2
msgid ""
"Set the flight mode to either stabilize or AltHold (Althold recommended)."
msgstr "将飞行模式设置为 Stabilize 或 AltHold（推荐 AltHold）。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:182
#: dd2284a316564d7195a9874792ea56d5
msgid "Enable motor interlock and allow rotors to complete runup."
msgstr "启用电机联锁并允许旋翼完成加速启动。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:183
#: f6c925d814d549ae848bb3758b68dcdf
msgid ""
"Lift off and establish stable hover approximately 3-5 meters above the "
"ground."
msgstr "起飞并在离地约 3-5 米处建立稳定悬停。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:184
#: f956ff4e3fd54dfead2b34b73ad31c12
msgid "Switch into AutoTune and center all sticks."
msgstr "切换到 AutoTune 并将所有摇杆居中。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:185
#: 846a6d88737c410fb1477469930e9b5e
msgid "AutoTune will start conducting the maneuvers."
msgstr "AutoTune 将开始执行机动动作。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:187
#: 88a30c2047ad40babce95aa92c8e8ba1
msgid "If you don’t see anything happening, verify your sticks are centered."
msgstr "如果没有看到任何反应，请确认摇杆已居中。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:189
#: 0381be07c0c744e3ad8bfea15f8dd068
msgid ""
"After the tuning is complete, a message will appear in the GCS saying "
"\"AutoTune complete\"."
msgstr "调参完成后，地面站将显示\"AutoTune complete\"消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:190
#: 360964a602364893b4f8ecd8922fee47
msgid ""
"To test the settings, switch out of AutoTune and then back to AutoTune and "
"you will be able to test the settings that were tuned."
msgstr "要测试设置，先退出 AutoTune，然后再切换回 AutoTune，您将能够测试已调参的设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:192
#: e8a974851ed943828cefc054a48876e6
msgid ""
"Once you are finished testing, descend and land in AutoTune.  Once the "
"aircraft has landed, the engine will shutdown on its own.  At that point "
"flip your motor interlock switch to disabled and disarm the aircraft."
msgstr "测试完成后，在 AutoTune 模式下下降并降落。飞行器落地后，发动机将自动关闭。届时将电机联锁开关拨至禁用位置并为飞行器上锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:196
#: 278a0e2ab55a472c9172456ddd4088bd
msgid ""
"Aircraft must be disarmed in the AutoTune flight mode to save the gain "
"settings."
msgstr "飞行器必须在 AutoTune 飞行模式下上锁才能保存增益设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:199
#: 1145dcf9a3fe4e87b3813e17fff50d66
msgid "Tuning Maneuver Descriptions"
msgstr "调参机动说明"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:202
#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:240
#: 51037a3e550e49729fed90d0bc1e39c1 85449294aa3e4465a8da58fd3f65446f
msgid "``ATC_RAT_xxx_FF`` Tuning"
msgstr "``ATC_RAT_xxx_FF`` 调参"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:204
#: b714e1e15666445fb8df7119f283e8fa
msgid ""
"In versions 4.6 and subsequent, the ``ATC_RAT_xxx_FF`` tuning is "
"accomplished by performing low frequency oscillations targeting an amplitude"
" of 5 deg.  The test will conduct 5 to 6 oscillations which will take 15 to "
"20 seconds.  This will be repeated to refine the feedforward gain.  Although"
" the requested amplitude is 5 deg, the actual amplitude may be larger.  If "
"the amplitude exceeds 10 to 15 deg or the oscillations are growing, the "
"autotune testing should be stopped. The following video demonstrates the "
"``ATC_RAT_xxx_FF`` tuning.  It shows the tuning in progress where "
"approximately 6 oscillations are done to test the gain with a short pause "
"and then another 6 oscillations.  During the pause, the gains are being "
"updated and the test is conducted again until the tuning is complete."
msgstr ""
"在 4.6 及后续版本中，``ATC_RAT_xxx_FF`` 调参通过执行目标幅度为 5 度的低频振荡来完成。测试将进行 5 到 6 次振荡，耗时 "
"15 到 20 秒。这将重复进行以优化前馈增益。尽管请求幅度为 5 度，实际幅度可能更大。如果幅度超过 10 到 15 "
"度或振荡在增长，应停止自动调参测试。以下视频演示了 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_FF`` 调参过程。它显示了调参进行中，大约进行 6 "
"次振荡来测试增益，短暂暂停后再进行 6 次振荡。在暂停期间，增益正在更新，测试将再次进行直到调参完成。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:213
#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:254
#: 9afad53a97bf447c801de4840382a970 e9792ba4593849b8851a7b961308a644
msgid "``ATC_RAT_xxx_D`` and ``ATC_RAT_xxx_P`` Tuning"
msgstr "``ATC_RAT_xxx_D`` 和 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_P`` 调参"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:215
#: 1027d2ec8d00445785fb63c2fb8b1ecb
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``ATC_RAT_xxx_D`` and ``ATC_RAT_xxx_P`` tuning starts with determining the "
"maximum ``ATC_RAT_xxx_D`` and ``ATC_RAT_xxx_P`` gains that can be safely "
"tuned.  A frequency sweep is conducted from the "
":ref:`AUTOTUNE_FRQ_MIN<AUTOTUNE_FRQ_MIN>` to "
":ref:`AUTOTUNE_FRQ_MAX<AUTOTUNE_FRQ_MAX>`.  This determines the approximate "
"frequency required for calculating the maximum allowable gains.  A series of"
" dwells (oscillations at one frequency) are completed to more accurately "
"determine the data required to calculate the maximum allowable "
"``ATC_RAT_xxx_D`` and ``ATC_RAT_xxx_P`` gains. Next another frequency sweep "
"is conducted to approximate the frequency for tuning ``ATC_RAT_xxx_D`` gain."
"  Then the ``ATC_RAT_xxx_D`` gain is raised until the response gain stops "
"decreasing. Next the ``ATC_RAT_xxx_P`` gain is increased until the response "
"gain exceeds the :ref:`AUTOTUNE_GN_MAX<AUTOTUNE_GN_MAX>`.  During this "
"tuning, you can’t make any inputs to hold position during the tuning however"
" the logic includes position holding during the test maneuver but not "
"between maneuvers.  If you make any inputs, then it will stop the tuning and"
" wait until you center the sticks before it begins again.  The aircraft will"
" drift very little during the maneuver.  If it is drifting more than 10 "
"meters during the maneuver then the :ref:`Velocity P Gain<AUTOTUNE_VELXY_P>`"
" can be increased to minimize drifting.  In between the oscillation "
"maneuvers, it may drift if the aircraft wasn't properly trimmed for hover.  "
"The  :ref:`Velocity P Gain<AUTOTUNE_VELXY_P>` gain will not help with that. "
"The tuning sweeps are 23 seconds in duration.  The following video "
"demonstrates the ``ATC_RAT_xxx_D`` and ``ATC_RAT_xxx_P`` tuning."
msgstr ""
"``ATC_RAT_xxx_D`` 和 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_P`` 调参从确定可以安全调参的最大 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_D`` 和 "
"``ATC_RAT_xxx_P`` 增益开始。从 :ref:`AUTOTUNE_FRQ_MIN<AUTOTUNE_FRQ_MIN>` 到 "
":ref:`AUTOTUNE_FRQ_MAX<AUTOTUNE_FRQ_MAX>` "
"进行频率扫频。这确定了计算最大允许增益所需的近似频率。通过一系列驻波（在单一频率下振荡）来更精确地确定计算最大允许 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_D`` "
"和 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_P`` 增益所需的数据。接下来进行另一次频率扫频以近似 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_D`` 增益调参所需的频率。然后升高"
" ``ATC_RAT_xxx_D`` 增益直到响应增益停止下降。接下来升高 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_P`` 增益直到响应增益超过 "
":ref:`AUTOTUNE_GN_MAX<AUTOTUNE_GN_MAX>`。在此调参期间，您不能进行任何输入来保持调参期间的位置，但逻辑包含测试机动期间的位置保持而非机动间的保持。如果您进行任何输入，调参将停止并等待您将摇杆居中后再重新开始。飞行器在机动期间漂移非常小。如果在机动期间漂移超过"
" 10 米，可以增加 :ref:`速度 P 增益<AUTOTUNE_VELXY_P>` "
"来减少漂移。在振荡机动之间，如果飞行器未正确配平悬停，可能会漂移。:ref:`速度 P 增益<AUTOTUNE_VELXY_P>` "
"增益对此没有帮助。调参扫频持续时间为 23 秒。以下视频演示了 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_D`` 和 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_P`` 调参。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:220
#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:272
#: 30f041aa216648e48baf81a702dce501 b340092a7dea4b2f95bccdd5775b954f
msgid "``ATC_ANG_xxx_P`` Tuning"
msgstr "``ATC_ANG_xxx_P`` 调参"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:222
#: fb371183d1f0444894fc977d23b95744
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``ATC_ANG_xxx_P`` tuning starts with conducting a frequency sweep from from "
"the :ref:`AUTOTUNE_FRQ_MIN<AUTOTUNE_FRQ_MIN>` to "
":ref:`AUTOTUNE_FRQ_MAX<AUTOTUNE_FRQ_MAX>`.  This determines the approximate "
"frequency for the maximum response gain.  Then dwells (oscillations at one "
"frequency) are conducted to tune the ``ATC_ANG_xxx_P`` gain. The gain is "
"raised or lowered to determine the ``ATC_ANG_xxx_P`` gain that corresponds "
"to a response gain (output angle/input angle request) that matches "
":ref:`AUTOTUNE_GN_MAX<AUTOTUNE_GN_MAX>`. During this tuning, you can’t make "
"any inputs to hold position during the tuning however the logic includes "
"position holding during the test maneuver but not between maneuvers.   If "
"you make any inputs, then it will stop the tuning and wait until you center "
"the sticks before it begins again. If it is drifting more than 10 meters "
"during the maneuver then the :ref:`Velocity P Gain<AUTOTUNE_VELXY_P>` can be"
" increased to minimize drifting. In between the oscillation maneuvers, it "
"may drift if the aircraft wasn't properly trimmed for hover. The  "
":ref:`Velocity P Gain<AUTOTUNE_VELXY_P>` gain will not help with that. The "
"tuning sweeps are 23 seconds in duration."
msgstr ""
"``ATC_ANG_xxx_P`` 调参从 :ref:`AUTOTUNE_FRQ_MIN<AUTOTUNE_FRQ_MIN>` 到 "
":ref:`AUTOTUNE_FRQ_MAX<AUTOTUNE_FRQ_MAX>` "
"进行频率扫频开始。这确定了最大响应增益的近似频率。然后通过驻波（在单一频率下振荡）来调参 ``ATC_ANG_xxx_P`` "
"增益。增益升高或降低以确定与响应增益（输出角度/输入角度请求）匹配 :ref:`AUTOTUNE_GN_MAX<AUTOTUNE_GN_MAX>` 的 "
"``ATC_ANG_xxx_P`` "
"增益。在此调参期间，您不能进行任何输入来保持调参期间的位置，但逻辑包含测试机动期间的位置保持而非机动间的保持。如果您进行任何输入，调参将停止并等待您将摇杆居中后再重新开始。如果在机动期间漂移超过"
" 10 米，可以增加 :ref:`速度 P 增益<AUTOTUNE_VELXY_P>` "
"来减少漂移。在振荡机动之间，如果飞行器未正确配平悬停，可能会漂移。:ref:`速度 P 增益<AUTOTUNE_VELXY_P>` "
"增益对此没有帮助。调参扫频持续时间为 23 秒。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:229
#: a69adfa92c904f48a1076b1e9f5d37a9
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"This test determines the maximum ``ATC_RAT_xxx_D`` and ``ATC_RAT_xxx_P`` "
"gains that can be safely tuned.  A frequency sweep is conducted from the "
":ref:`AUTOTUNE_FRQ_MIN<AUTOTUNE_FRQ_MIN>` to "
":ref:`AUTOTUNE_FRQ_MAX<AUTOTUNE_FRQ_MAX>`.  This determines the approximate "
"frequency required for calculating the maximum allowable gains.  A series of"
" dwells (oscillations at one frequency) are completed to more accurately "
"determine the data required to calculate the maximum allowable "
"``ATC_RAT_xxx_D`` and ``ATC_RAT_xxx_P`` gains. The maximum allowable gains "
"are provided in a GCS message.  Although these are termed maximum allowable "
"gains, it is not recommended that these gains be used without any buildup as"
" they would most likely cause feedback oscillations.  Experience has shown "
"that ``ATC_RAT_xxx_D`` gains up to 25-35% of the maximum allowable value can"
" be used safely and ``ATC_RAT_xxx_P`` gains of up to 50% of the maximum "
"allowable gain can be used safely.  If you make any inputs, then it will "
"stop the gain determination test and wait until you center the sticks before"
" it begins again.  The aircraft will drift very little during the maneuver."
"  If it is drifting more than 10 meters during the maneuver then the "
":ref:`Velocity P Gain<AUTOTUNE_VELXY_P>` can be increased to minimize "
"drifting.  In between the oscillation maneuvers, it may drift if the "
"aircraft wasn't properly trimmed for hover.  The  :ref:`Velocity P "
"Gain<AUTOTUNE_VELXY_P>` gain will not help with that. The frequency sweeps "
"are 23 seconds in duration."
msgstr ""
"此测试确定可以安全调参的最大 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_D`` 和 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_P`` 增益。从 "
":ref:`AUTOTUNE_FRQ_MIN<AUTOTUNE_FRQ_MIN>` 到 "
":ref:`AUTOTUNE_FRQ_MAX<AUTOTUNE_FRQ_MAX>` "
"进行频率扫频。这确定了计算最大允许增益所需的近似频率。通过一系列驻波（在单一频率下振荡）来更精确地确定计算最大允许 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_D`` "
"和 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_P`` "
"增益所需的数据。地面站消息中提供了最大允许增益。尽管这些被称为最大允许增益，但不建议在没有逐步增加的情况下使用这些增益，因为它们很可能导致反馈振荡。经验表明，``ATC_RAT_xxx_D``"
" 增益最高可安全使用最大允许值的 25-35%，``ATC_RAT_xxx_P`` 增益最高可安全使用最大允许增益的 "
"50%。如果您进行任何输入，增益确定测试将停止并等待您将摇杆居中后再重新开始。飞行器在机动期间漂移非常小。如果在机动期间漂移超过 10 米，可以增加 "
":ref:`速度 P 增益<AUTOTUNE_VELXY_P>` 来减少漂移。在振荡机动之间，如果飞行器未正确配平悬停，可能会漂移。:ref:`速度 P"
" 增益<AUTOTUNE_VELXY_P>` 增益对此没有帮助。频率扫频持续时间为 23 秒。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:234
#: 4118adacfffb4bdcb61e76c40451baee
msgid ""
"This test allows the user to look at the final tune in the frequency domain."
"  It consists of one frequency sweep to obtain the frequency domain data "
"that can be viewed in the log file.  If you make any inputs during the "
"frequency sweep, then it will stop the tune check test and wait until you "
"center the sticks before it begins again, starting the sweep over.  The "
"aircraft will drift very little during the maneuver.  If it is drifting more"
" than 10 meters during the maneuver then the :ref:`Velocity P "
"Gain<AUTOTUNE_VELXY_P>` can be increased to minimize drifting. The frequency"
" sweeps are 23 seconds in duration."
msgstr ""
"此测试允许用户在频域中查看最终调参结果。它由一次频率扫频组成，以获取可在日志文件中查看的频域数据。如果在频率扫频期间进行任何输入，调参检验测试将停止并等待您将摇杆居中后再重新开始，重新开始扫频。飞行器在机动期间漂移非常小。如果在机动期间漂移超过"
" 10 米，可以增加 :ref:`速度 P 增益<AUTOTUNE_VELXY_P>` 来减少漂移。频率扫频持续时间为 23 秒。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:237
#: 8a456c38d999473eb778fdcb7b6a5b0a
msgid "Log Analysis"
msgstr "日志分析"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:241
#: a6d09b9a0227434aa8b42cef91928c16
msgid ""
"After completing the ``ATC_RAT_xxx_FF`` tuning, the log should be reviewed "
"to ensure the code determined the value of ``ATC_RAT_xxx_FF`` gain "
"correctly.  Unless head speed is very low, this gain should not be above "
"0.3. The graph below shows a time history of the target and actual rates for"
" a FF tuning test."
msgstr ""
"完成 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_FF`` 调参后，应检查日志以确保代码正确确定了 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_FF`` "
"增益的值。除非转速非常低，否则此增益不应超过 0.3。下图显示了 FF 调参测试中目标速率和实际速率的时间历程。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:246
#: 2faa2bb83e8d4c239ac088959a73e567
msgid ""
"In the time history, an example of a good capture of the FF gain is shown "
"the pitch up part of the tuning.  The actual rate is slightly below the "
"target as it reaches the steady state.  Next the pitch down FF tuning is "
"conducted and it can be seen that the rate appears to drop off before "
"achieving steady state.  The FF gain is increased but it can be seen that "
"the actual rate exceeds the target which results in the FF gain being too "
"high.  If you see behavior like this, it is best to take the FF gain found "
"where the rate is slightly below the target rate and manually enter it for "
"the ``ATC_RAT_xxx_FF`` gain."
msgstr ""
"在时间历程中，展示了一个成功捕获 FF 增益的示例，即调参的俯仰上升部分。实际速率在达到稳态时略低于目标速率。接下来进行俯仰下降 FF "
"调参，可以看到速率似乎在达到稳态之前就下降了。FF 增益被增加，但可以看到实际速率超过了目标速率，导致 FF "
"增益过高。如果您看到这种情况，最好取实际速率略低于目标速率时的 FF 增益，并将其手动输入为 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_FF`` 增益。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:248
#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:266
#: 62bba0c568df44bf8ccefa1a27ec94bc a226f302ac59481fa0b74a3853dc8d65
msgid "The video discusses what to look for in the log."
msgstr "视频讨论了在日志中应该关注什么。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:255
#: b6ce7a97ddde462489f6e34592c3788f
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"After completing the ``ATC_RAT_xxx_D`` and ``ATC_RAT_xxx_P`` tuning, the log"
" should be reviewed to ensure the gains were determined correctly.  If the "
"``ATC_RAT_xxx_D`` gain is zero after tuning, it can be adjusted manually by "
"finding the max allowable gain provided in the GCS messages found in the bin"
" log file.  Use 10% of the gain provided as rate_d given at the end of the "
"max gain test. The messages look like this"
msgstr ""
"完成 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_D`` 和 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_P`` 调参后，应检查日志以确保增益被正确确定。如果调参后 "
"``ATC_RAT_xxx_D`` 增益为零，可以通过在 bin 日志文件的 GCS 消息中找到的最大允许增益手动调整。使用最大增益测试结束时给出的 "
"rate_d 值的 10% 作为速率 D 增益。消息如下所示"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:257
#: 8ac58b614b944f6d908eb2fbb050def1
msgid ""
"AutoTune: Max rate P freq=23.62473 gain=6.239318 AutoTune: ph=161.0000 "
"rate_p=0.121300 AutoTune: Max Rate D freq=41.98507 gain=1.493140 AutoTune: "
"ph=251.0000 rate_d=0.012072"
msgstr ""
"AutoTune: Max rate P freq=23.62473 gain=6.239318 AutoTune: ph=161.0000 "
"rate_p=0.121300 AutoTune: Max Rate D freq=41.98507 gain=1.493140 AutoTune: "
"ph=251.0000 rate_d=0.012072"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:262
#: 3fd48b6067cb4636b0620d678a52fc2b
msgid ""
"Therefore in this case, a value for ``ATC_RAT_xxx_D`` of 0.0012 could be "
"manually entered and also manually change ``ATC_RAT_xxx_P`` to zero.  Then "
"run the autotune test again.  If ``ATC_RAT_xxx_D`` gain has not changed from"
" the value manually entered accept the tuned values and move on to "
"``ATC_ANG_xxx_P`` tuning."
msgstr ""
"因此在这种情况下，可以手动输入 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_D`` 的值为 0.0012，并手动将 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_P`` "
"更改为零。然后再次运行自动调参测试。如果 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_D`` 增益没有从手动输入的值改变，则接受调参后的值并继续进行 "
"``ATC_ANG_xxx_P`` 调参。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:264
#: d7655ad5826549d99d5e52cfadcb7dc4
msgid ""
"The most common problem that may be experienced with the ``ATC_RAT_xxx_P`` "
"tuning is the :ref:`Maximum Response Gain<AUTOTUNE_GN_MAX>` may be set too "
"low.  It may require viewing the log to determine the highest response gain."
"  Then set the :ref:`Maximum Response Gain<AUTOTUNE_GN_MAX>` higher but "
"don't exceed 2.2 as the response could have larger overshoots when capturing"
" an attitude."
msgstr ""
"``ATC_RAT_xxx_P`` 调参中最常见的问题是 :ref:`最大响应增益<AUTOTUNE_GN_MAX>` "
"可能设置过低。可能需要查看日志来确定最高响应增益。然后将 :ref:`最大响应增益<AUTOTUNE_GN_MAX>` 设置得更高，但不要超过 "
"2.2，因为捕获姿态时响应可能有更大的超调。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:273
#: 5561fb65fd8c4580bbceef756f74ce88
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"After completing the ``ATC_ANG_xxx_P`` tuning, the log should be reviewed to"
" ensure the gains were determined correctly. Be sure to set the "
":ref:`Maximum Response Gain<AUTOTUNE_GN_MAX>` slightly higher than the value"
" used for the ``ATC_RAT_xxx_D`` and ``ATC_RAT_xxx_P`` tuning, maybe 10% "
"higher.  In this tuning, the frequency where the max response gain occurs is"
" determined in the frequency response.  Then the  ``ATC_ANG_xxx_P`` gain is "
"raised or lowered to achieve the desired response gain at the frequency "
"where the maximum response gain occurs.  Below is an example of the "
"frequency sweep from the ``ATC_ANG_xxx_P`` tuning."
msgstr ""
"完成 ``ATC_ANG_xxx_P`` 调参后，应检查日志以确保增益被正确确定。务必将 :ref:`最大响应增益<AUTOTUNE_GN_MAX>` "
"设置为略高于 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_D`` 和 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_P`` 调参所用值，可能高 "
"10%。在此调参中，在频率响应中确定最大响应增益出现的频率。然后升高或降低 ``ATC_ANG_xxx_P`` "
"增益以在最大响应增益出现的频率处达到期望的响应增益。以下是 ``ATC_ANG_xxx_P`` 调参中频率扫频的示例。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autotune.rst:278
#: 1d4656f68a5240ecbbfa4740c7a3a931
msgid ""
"In this example, the response gain (ATSH.gain) has a peak shown in the "
"graph.  The table below shows the dwells completed after the frequency sweep"
" where the ``ATC_ANG_xxx_P`` was raised until the response gain met the "
":ref:`Maximum Response Gain<AUTOTUNE_GN_MAX>` value which was 2.0 in this "
"case.  It is important to ensure that the correct frequency was found.  In "
"cases like tuning the yaw axis, the response gain may not have a peak and a "
"low frequency may be chosen which will not result in a proper tuning of the "
"gain.  In this case, the ``ATC_ANG_xxx_P`` gain may be manually set higher "
"by 1. So if the starting value was 4.5 then manually set it to 5.5 and run "
"the ``ATC_ANG_xxx_P`` tuning again."
msgstr ""
"在此示例中，图中显示响应增益（ATSH.gain）有一个峰值。下表显示了频率扫频后完成的驻波，其中 ``ATC_ANG_xxx_P`` "
"被升高，直到响应增益达到 :ref:`最大响应增益<AUTOTUNE_GN_MAX>` 值（本例中为 "
"2.0）。确保找到正确的频率很重要。在调参偏航轴等情况下，响应增益可能没有峰值，可能选择低频，这不会导致增益的正确调参。在这种情况下，``ATC_ANG_xxx_P``"
" 增益可以手动增加 1。因此，如果起始值为 4.5，则手动将其设为 5.5，然后再次运行 ``ATC_ANG_xxx_P`` 调参。"
